      "q": "How much does World Wide Technology make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "World Wide Technology has $337M in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. World Wide Technology has 274 awards so far this fiscal year and an average award size of $1.2M. Obligations are down 34.0% year over year."
